@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Android Tor sidecar
+
+Binary name: `libtor.so`.
+
+This tree does not vendor that library. Until the host process finds it and a
+loopback SOCKS listener is up on `127.0.0.1:9070` (control `127.0.0.1:9071`),
+the Rx chip status is `unprivate unless tor`.
+
+Port `1080` is the Restore Privacy VPN proxy. It is not this sidecar.
+`webview_flutter` 4.13.0 is the WebView package for Android, iOS, and macOS.
+It is not a dependency in `wallet/pubspec.yaml`.
